","offset":39,"start":104.623,"end":104.723,"score":0.984},{"text":"8","offset":43,"start":104.862,"end":105.043,"score":0.608},{"text":"o'clock","offset":45,"start":105.102,"end":105.463,"score":0.692},{"text":"train","offset":53,"start":105.562,"end":105.943,"score":0.999},{"text":"did","offset":59,"start":106.102,"end":106.243,"score":0.999},{"text":"not","offset":63,"start":106.302,"end":106.503,"score":0.999},{"text":"run","offset":67,"start":106.602,"end":106.763,"score":1.0},{"text":"at","offset":71,"start":106.822,"end":106.923,"score":0.999},{"text":"all.","offset":74,"start":107.043,"end":107.263,"score":0.902}],[{"text":"It","offset":0,"start":108.422,"end":108.483,"score":0.997},{"text":"broke","offset":3,"start":108.623,"end":108.923,"score":0.974},{"text":"down","offset":9,"start":109.082,"end":109.443,"score":0.981},{"text":"at","offset":14,"start":109.543,"end":109.603,"score":0.895},{"text":"Ferngreen","offset":17,"start":109.763,"end":110.443,"score":0.963},{"text":"station","offset":27,"start":110.582,"end":111.063,"score":0.965},{"text":"and","offset":35,"start":111.483,"end":111.583,"score":0.998},{"text":"was","offset":39,"start":111.683,"end":111.783,"score":1.0},{"text":"taken","offset":43,"start":111.903,"end":112.283,"score":1.0},{"text":"off","offset":49,"start":112.483,"end":112.583,"score":1.0},{"text":"the","offset":53,"start":112.683,"end":112.743,"score":1.0},{"text":"line.'","offset":57,"start":112.802,"end":113.143,"score":0.994}]],"cues":[{"id":"b2-087-001","sourceId":"b2-087-001","sourceIndex":0,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,7],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"What was wrong with the man's story?","start":13.61,"end":16.55,"score":0.98,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-087-002","sourceId":"b2-087-002","sourceIndex":1,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,20],"wordModel":"english-ctc-fallback","text":"'At the time the murder was committed, I was travelling on the 8 o'clock train to London,' said the man.","start":19.242,"end":27.04,"score":0.986,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":true,"reviewReasons":["boundary-disagreement"]},{"id":"b2-087-003","sourceId":"b2-087-003","sourceIndex":2,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,8],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"'Do you always catch such an early train?'","start":28.61,"end":31.82,"score":0.966,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-087-004","sourceId":"b2-087-004","sourceIndex":3,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,3],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"asked the inspector.","start":32.28,"end":33.69,"score":0.957,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-087-005","sourceId":"b2-087-005","sourceIndex":4,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,7],"wordModel":"english-ctc-fallback","text":"'Of course I do,' answered the man.","start":34.99,"end":37.9,"score":0.984,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":true,"reviewReasons":["boundary-disagreement"]},{"id":"b2-087-006","sourceId":"b2-087-006","sourceIndex":5,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,8],"wordModel":"english-ctc-fallback","text":"'I must be at work at 10 o'clock.","start":38.87,"end":41.56,"score":0.991,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":true,"reviewReasons":["boundary-disagreement"]},{"id":"b2-087-007","sourceId":"b2-087-007","sourceIndex":6,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,10],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"My employer will confirm that I was there on time.'","start":42.42,"end":45.76,"score":0.978,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-087-008","sourceId":"b2-087-008","sourceIndex":7,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,10],"wordModel":"english-ctc-fallback","text":"'Would a later train get you to work on time?'","start":48.07,"end":51.43,"score":0.979,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":true,"reviewReasons":["boundary-disagreement"]},{"id":"b2-087-009","sourceId":"b2-087-009","sourceIndex":8,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,3],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"asked the inspector.","start":51.85,"end":53.45,"score":0.949,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-087-010","sourceId":"b2-087-010","sourceIndex":9,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,11],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"'I suppose it would, but I never catch a later train.'","start":55.25,"end":59.63,"score":0.964,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-087-011","sourceId":"b2-087-011","sourceIndex":10,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,9],"wordModel":"english-ctc-fallback","text":"'At what time did you arrive at the station?'","start":62.03,"end":65.06,"score":0.988,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":true,"reviewReasons":["boundary-disagreement"]},{"id":"b2-087-012","sourceId":"b2-087-012","sourceIndex":11,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,4],"wordModel":"english-ctc-fallback","text":"'At ten to eight.","start":66.78,"end":68.01,"score":0.982,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-087-013","sourceId":"b2-087-013","sourceIndex":12,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,9],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"I bought a paper and waited for the train.'","start":69.22,"end":72.12,"score":0.98,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-087-014","sourceId":"b2-087-014","sourceIndex":13,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,6],"wordModel":"english-ctc-fallback","text":"'And you didn't notice anything unusual?'","start":74.482,"end":78.07,"score":0.979,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":true,"reviewReasons":["boundary-disagreement"]},{"id":"b2-087-015","sourceId":"b2-087-015","sourceIndex":14,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,3],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"'Of course not.'","start":79.51,"end":80.68,"score":0.862,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-087-016","sourceId":"b2-087-016","sourceIndex":15,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,12],"wordModel":"english-ctc-fallback","text":"'I suggest,' said the inspector,' that you are not telling the truth.","start":82.743,"end":88.22,"score":0.986,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":true,"reviewReasons":["boundary-disagreement"]},{"id":"b2-087-017-p01","sourceId":"b2-087-017","sourceIndex":16,"part":1,"parts":2,"wordRange":[0,11],"wordModel":"english-ctc-fallback","text":"I suggest that you did not catch the 8 o'clock train,","start":89.27,"end":93.45,"score":0.986,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-087-017-p02","sourceId":"b2-087-017","sourceIndex":16,"part":2,"parts":2,"wordRange":[11,26],"wordModel":"english-ctc-fallback","text":"but that you caught the 8.25 which would still get you to work on time.","start":94.08,"end":99.65,"score":0.962,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-087-018","sourceId":"b2-087-018","sourceIndex":17,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,17],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"You see, on the morning of the murder, the 8 o'clock train did not run at all.","start":101.04,"end":107.39,"score":0.943,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-087-019","sourceId":"b2-087-019","sourceIndex":18,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,12],"wordModel":"english-ctc-fallback","text":"It broke down at Ferngreen station and was taken off the line.'","start":108.31,"end":113.37,"score":0.981,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":true,"reviewReasons":["boundary-disagreement"]}]}
